# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4357
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%.25s\"\n"
"is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Since they are different users, they won't be reading/writing\n"
"the same ~/.xscreensaver file, so %s isn't\n"
"going to work right.\n"
"\n"
"You should either re-run %s as \"%s\", or re-run\n"
"xscreensaver as \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Restart the XScreenSaver daemon now?\n"
msgstr ""
"%s veikia kaip vartotojas \"%s\"priimančioje\"%s“.\n"
"Tačiau XScreenSaver valdantis ekraną \"%.25s“\n"
"veikia kaip vartotojas \"%s\"priimančioje\"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Kadangi jie yra skirtingi vartotojai, jie neskaitys / nerašys\n"
"tas pats ~/.xscreensaver failas, taigi %s nėra\n"
"eiti į darbą teisingai.\n"
"\n"
"Turėtumėte arba paleisti iš naujo %s kaip \"%s“ arba paleiskite iš naujo\n"
"xscreensaver kaip \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Iš naujo paleisti XScreenSaver demoną dabar?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4381
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%s\"\n"
"is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"If those two machines don't share a file system (that is,\n"
"if they don't see the same ~%s/.xscreensaver file) then\n"
"%s won't work right.\n"
"\n"
"Restart the daemon on \"%s\" as \"%s\" now?\n"
msgstr ""
"%s veikia kaip vartotojas \"%s\"priimančioje\"%s“.\n"
"Tačiau XScreenSaver valdantis ekraną \"%s“\n"
"veikia kaip vartotojas \"%s\"priimančioje\"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Jei tie du įrenginiai nesidalija failų sistema (ty\n"
"jei jie nemato to paties ~%s/.xscreensaver failą), tada\n"
"%s neveiks gerai.\n"
"\n"
"Iš naujo paleiskite demoną \"%s\"kaip\"%s\"dabar?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4402
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is %s version %s.\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%s\"\n"
"is version %s.  This could cause problems.\n"
"\n"
"Restart the XScreenSaver daemon now?\n"
msgstr ""
"Tai yra %s versija %s.\n"
"Tačiau XScreenSaver valdantis ekraną \"%s“\n"
"yra versija %s.  Tai gali sukelti problemų.\n"
"\n"
"Iš naujo paleisti XScreenSaver demoną dabar?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4432
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The GNOME screen saver daemon (%s) appears to be running.\n"
"It must be stopped for XScreenSaver to work properly.\n"
"\n"
