"values in their path.  Then, as they pass over changed pixels, their\n"
"behavior is influenced.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Written by David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "
